[{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0382","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0382.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53323","title":"Linux kernel ext2 文件系统 DAX 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ext2 文件系统的 DAX 模式下存在缺陷，当调用 ext2_setsize 函数且长度参数为页面对齐值时，PAGE_ALIGN 宏直接返回原值，导致 dax_zero_range 以长度 0 调用 iomap_begin，进而触发 ext2_get_blocks 中的 BUG_ON(maxblocks==0) 内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过在 DAX 挂载的 ext2 文件系统上执行 truncate -s 0 命令触发此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.3-rc2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53323"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-16T17:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:53Z","remediation":"升级到 Linux 内核 v6.3 及以上版本（或对应 LTS 发行版的内核更新，如 RHEL 9.4+、Ubuntu 23.04+），已合入上游修复 commit \"ext2/dax: Fix ext2_setsize when len is page aligned\"。如无法升级内核，可通过补丁方式手动 cherry-pick 该提交并重新编译内核。业务层面避免在 DAX 挂载的 ext2 文件系统上执行 `truncate -s 0` 操作作为临时规避措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5cee8bfb8cbd99c97aff85d2bf066b6a496e13ab","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9e54fd14bd143c261e52fde74355e85e9526c58c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fcced95b6ba2a507a83b8b3e0358a8ac16b13e35","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53323.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53323.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53323.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53323","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53323.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53323.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-2f9c-chxh-5h7v/GHSA-2f9c-chxh-5h7v.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53323","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53323.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71885.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0382.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0381","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0381.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53292","title":"Linux kernel blk-mq 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 blk-mq 块设备多队列子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞，当系统进行 I/O 调度器切换操作时，函数 blk_mq_elv_switch_none 在获取 q->sysfs_lock 锁后，q->elevator 指针可能因并发调度器切换而被置空，导致空指针解引用引发内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过构造特定 I/O 调度器切换场景触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53292"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-16T08:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:45Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本: 5.10 系列 ≥ 5.10.202, 5.15 系列 ≥ 5.15.141, 6.1 系列 ≥ 6.1.66, 6.6 系列 ≥ 6.6.5, 或主线 ≥ 6.7。无法立即升级时，可通过内核启动参数 `elevator=none` 禁用 IO 调度器切换作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/245165658e1c9f95c0fecfe02b9b1ebd30a1198a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3e977386521b71471e66ec2ba82efdfcc456adf2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/988ddb77218d3975dd13dee7bb0e1fae098a9fdb","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53292.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53292.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53292.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53292","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53292.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53292.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/03/seguranca/cve-2023-53292-blk-mq-fix-null-dereference-on-q-el-1764810095000.md","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53292","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53292.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71203.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0381.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0380","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0380.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53261","title":"Linux kernel coresight 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 coresight 驱动中存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401），位于 drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-platform.c。在 ACPI 缓冲区处理过程中，acpi_get_dsd_graph() 返回后未释放 buf.pointer 指向的内存，导致已分配内存无法回收。具有本地低权限的攻击者可反复触发相关代码路径，持续消耗系统内存，最终导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.3 至 6.5.3 之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。内核社区已通过将临时变量移至 acpi_coresight_parse_graph() 并在函数返回前释放缓冲区的方式修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53261"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:39Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.5.3 或更高版本（稳定版已包含修复提交 d1b60e7c9fee），或向后移植补丁 https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1a9e02673e2550f5612099e64e8761f0c8fc0f50 至当前内核。临时缓解措施：在不使用 CoreSight 调试功能的系统上，可卸载 coresight 驱动模块或通过内核命令行参数禁用相关 ACPI 设备节点以防止触发内存泄漏。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1a9e02673e2550f5612099e64e8761f0c8fc0f50","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d1b60e7c9fee34eaedf1fc4e0471f75b33f83a4a","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-53261.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53261.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53261.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53261.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53261","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53261.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-53261.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/08/seguranca/cve-2023-53261-coresight-fix-memory-leak-in-acpi-b-1765244229000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-5qhg-ffc9-x697/GHSA-5qhg-ffc9-x697.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53261"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0380.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0379","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0379.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53254","title":"Linux Kernel cacheinfo 共享缓存映射越界读取漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 cacheinfo 子系统在处理不同层级共享缓存时存在越界读取漏洞。由于 shared_cpu_map 在构建时仅检查相同索引的缓存共享关系，当 CPU 间缓存层级结构不一致时，会触发 slab 越界访问（CWE-125），且当共享缓存在不同 CPU 上索引不同时会导致 CPU 映射错误。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞获取敏感内核内存信息，影响使用该内核版本的所有 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53254"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:52Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:38Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.18、6.2.5 或 6.3 及以上版本对应稳定分支已包含修复提交（commit dea49f2993f5、2f588d0345d6、198102c9103f）。无法升级时可手动 cherry-pick 上述三个补丁至 affected 内核的 `drivers/base/cacheinfo.c` 并重新编译内核模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/198102c9103fc78d8478495971947af77edb05c1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2f588d0345d69a35e451077afed428fd057a5e34","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dea49f2993f57d8a2df2cacb0bf649ef49b28879","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-53254.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53254.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53254.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53254.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53254","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5462df1242ecdfa07cb8ddac80e6ca8fcb2b6836/2023/CVE-2023-53254.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53254.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/04/seguranca/cve-2023-53254-cacheinfo-fix-shared-cpu-map-to-han-1764896554000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-7h3h-qq7m-57c9/GHSA-7h3h-qq7m-57c9.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53254"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0379.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0378","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53248","title":"Linux kernel AMDGPU 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AMDGPU 显卡驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞，具体位于 amdgpu 虚拟内存管理模块中。当使用 CPU 更新页表时，虚拟机更新围栏（fence）未被使用并被设置为 NULL 指针，后续调用 dma_fence_wait() 时触发空指针解引用，导致系统崩溃或拒绝服务。攻击者可通过构造特定 GPU 操作序列触发此漏洞，影响使用 AMD Radeon 显卡的 Linux 系统。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53248"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:52Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:37Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级到 6.1.47、6.4.12 或 6.5 及以上版本，或 cherry-pick 补丁提交 78b25110eb8c、aa9e9ba5748c、187916e6ed9d 三者之一到当前内核源码树并重新编译。该漏洞需本地低权限触发，无法通过网络缓解，升级内核是唯一彻底修复方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/187916e6ed9d0c3b3abc27429f7a5f8c936bd1f0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/78b25110eb8c6990f7f5096bc0136c12a2b4cc99","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aa9e9ba5748c524eb0925a2ef6984b78793646d6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53248.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53248.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53248.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53248","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53248.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53248.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/04/seguranca/cve-2023-53248-drmamdgpu-install-stub-fence-into-p-1764896549000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-96mj-4fv4-g633/GHSA-96mj-4fv4-g633.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53248","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53248.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0377","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0377.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53247","title":"Linux kernel btrfs 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Btrfs 文件系统的 `btrfs_cont_expand` 函数中存在竞态条件漏洞。在调用 `read_folio` 读取页面内容后、重新加锁之前，`release_folio` 可能被触发并清除页面的私有数据（PagePrivate），导致后续访问子页面位图时触发断言失败，造成内核崩溃（拒绝服务）。本地攻击者可通过在启用子页面块大小的 Btrfs 文件系统上执行特定的文件写入或复制操作触发此漏洞，影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53247"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:37Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.5 及以上版本，或应用相应稳定版内核 (6.1.x/5.15.x) 中已包含该修复的补丁。对于无法立即升级的系统，可通过限制本地用户执行 copy_file_range 系统调用来降低触发概率，但最根本的措施仍是安装包含 commit 34b64e73f40a (\"btrfs: set_page_extent_mapped after read_folio in btrfs_cont_expand\") 的内核更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a5e0bc8e8618e32a6ca64450867628eb0a627bf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/17b17fcd6d446b95904a6929c40012ee7f0afc0c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a5880e69cf7fe4a0bb1eabae02205352d1b59b7b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53247.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53247.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53247.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53247","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53247.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53247.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/04/seguranca/cve-2023-53247-btrfs-set-page-extent-mapped-after--1764896543000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-73r6-2g26-rxx5/GHSA-73r6-2g26-rxx5.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53247","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53247.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0377.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0376","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0376.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53240","title":"Linux内核XSK Tx路径空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 XSK（XDP Socket）子系统的 Tx 路径中存在空指针解引用漏洞。在 sendmsg() 系统调用流程中，napi id 可以在接口未启用（IFF_UP 未设置）时被标记，随后进入 xsk_xmit() 函数时由于设备标志检查滞后，导致对空指针的访问，引发内核崩溃。攻击者可通过构造特制的 XSK 套接字程序，在未启动的网络接口上触发 Tx 操作，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53240"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:36Z","remediation":"此漏洞已在 Linux 内核主线版本 6.3 及稳定分支中修复，对应补丁提交为 commit 1596dae2f17ec、cecc68559cd5 和 ffe19750e68d。建议将内核升级至以下任一已修复版本：6.2.3 及以上、6.1.16 及以上、5.18 及以上（含对应补丁的长期支持版本如 5.15.x 需 cherry-pick 该补丁）。对于无法立即升级内核的环境，可在系统层面限制非授权用户对 AF_XDP 套接字的访问权限，或禁用 xdpsock 类型程序的执行以降低攻击面，但最彻底的修复仍是部署已合入补丁的内核版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1596dae2f17ec5c6e8c8f0e3fec78c5ae55c1e0b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cecc68559cd57fffb2be50685f262b9af2318e16","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ffe19750e68d0bb21e8110b398346eef20b156a7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53240.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53240.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53240","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53240.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53240.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53240.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/04/seguranca/cve-2023-53240-xsk-check-iff-up-earlier-in-tx-path-1764896537000.md","https://github.com/ctrliq/advisories/blob/b05bfbc3a1de170377430c48777435c2cc639f64/csaf/vex/cve/2023/cve-2023-53240.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53240","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53240.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0376.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0375","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0375.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53231","title":"Linux EROFS 文件系统原子上下文检测不当导致内核崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 EROFS 文件系统的 z_erofs_decompressqueue_endio 函数中对原子上下文的检测不充分，该函数可能在 RCU 锁保护下被 blk_mq_flush_plug_list 调用，此时处于原子上下文中却执行了 mutex_lock 等可能导致休眠的操作，触发内核 BUG，系统崩溃。该漏洞位于 fs/erofs/zdata.c，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。本地攻击者可通过对 EROFS 文件系统执行 I/O 操作（如触发 page cache 预读）来触发此条件，导致系统拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53231"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:50Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:34Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.25 以上版本或合入该补丁提交（修复位于 fs/erofs/decompressor.c 中，将原子上下文检测由 in_atomic() 改为 !in_task() 并增加 rcu_read_lock_any_held() 判断），即可避免在 RCU 锁定上下文中触发内核态休眠操作导致的 BUG。若无法立即升级，可在 dm-verity 场景下通过内核启动参数 `erofs_async_decompress=1` 强制所有解压缩走异步 worker 路径作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/12d0a24afd9ea58e581ea64d64e066f2027b28d9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/597fb60c75132719687e173b75cab8f6eb1ca657","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53231.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53231.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53231.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53231","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53231.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53231.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/08/seguranca/cve-2023-53231-erofs-fix-detection-of-atomic-conte-1765244308000.md","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53231","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53231.json","https://github.com/program377/CyberSec_ToolsKit/blob/4d205a2898b1d639c73f71f025dbf408ff7f8148/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0375.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0374","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0374.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53221","title":"Linux kernel BPF 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 子系统中存在内存泄漏漏洞。当通过 fentry 挂载 BPF 程序到内核函数失败时，已分配的 BPF trampoline 镜像未能正确释放，导致内核内存泄漏。本地低权限攻击者可通过加载特定 BPF 程序（如挂载到已释放的 trap_init 函数）触发该漏洞，通过检查 /proc/kallsyms 可发现残留的 trampoline 映像，最终可能导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53221"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:32Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下安全版本：5.10 系列升级至 5.10.28+，5.11 系列升级至 5.11.11+，6.1 系列升级至 6.1.39+，6.3 系列升级至 6.3.13+，6.4 系列升级至 6.4.4+，或直接升级至 6.5 及以上版本。对应补丁 commit 为 f72c67d1a82d（主线）及 108598c39ee、20109ddd5be、6aa27775db6（稳定分支）。无法立即升级时可通过 Seccomp 限制 BPF 系统调用（如 prctl(PR_SET_NO_NEW_PRIVS, 1) 后禁用 bpf()）作为临时缓解，但建议优先应用内核补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/108598c39eefbedc9882273ac0df96127a629220","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/20109ddd5bea2c24d790debf5d02584ef24c3f5e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6aa27775db63ba8c7c73891c7dfb71ddc230c48d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f72c67d1a82dada7d6d504c806e111e913721a30","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53221.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53221.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53221","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53221.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53221.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53221.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/04/seguranca/cve-2023-53221-bpf-fix-memleak-due-to-fentry-attac-1764896532000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-2px5-v96w-8g69/GHSA-2px5-v96w-8g69.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53221","https://github.com/openharmony/docs/blob/f41b9345badd47c7ab0c263344cd7f4b5a549afb/en/release-notes/OpenHarmony-v6.0.0.1-release.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0374.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0373","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0373.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53218","title":"Linux kernel RXRPC 连接分配前进程中止拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RxRPC 协议实现中存在资源管理缺陷，当用户态程序通过 sendmsg() 系统调用创建 rxrpc 调用时，调用会被排队等待连接和通道分配。如果当前调用在分配完成前被中断，后续 sendmsg() 调用将返回 EBUSY 错误且无法正常中止等待中的进程，导致系统资源无法释放。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53218"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:32Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.2.16 及以上版本（长期稳定分支）或 6.3.3/6.4 及以上版本，合入 rxrpc sendmsg 中断时调用终止的修复提交 0eb362d25481。如无法立即升级内核，可限制非信任用户对 AF_RXRPC 套接字的访问权限，或通过 seccomp 策略拦截 rxrpc 相关系统调用作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0eb362d254814ce04848730bf32e75b8ee1a4d6c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7161cf61c64e9e9413d790f2fa2b9dada71a2249","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/876d96faacbc407daf4978d7ec95051b68f5344a","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53218.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53218.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53218.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53218","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53218.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53218.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/04/seguranca/cve-2023-53218-rxrpc-make-it-so-that-a-waiting-pro-1764896526000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-749j-m4j7-mhr2/GHSA-749j-m4j7-mhr2.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53218","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53218.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0373.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0372","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0372.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53209","title":"Linux kernel mac80211_hwsim 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mac80211_hwsim 模拟 WiFi 驱动存在空指针解引用漏洞，在 mac80211_hwsim_select_tx_link() 函数中未对 sta 指针进行 NULL 有效性检查即直接访问，本地攻击者可利用特制条件触发空指针解引用，导致内核崩溃引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核相关版本，需本地权限方可利用。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53209"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:30Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.42、6.4.7 或更高版本，已包含修复提交 d0124848c794。如无法立即升级内核，可卸载 mac80211_hwsim 内核模块（modprobe -r mac80211_hwsim）并禁用其自动加载，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0cc80943ef518a1c51a1111e9346d1daf11dd545","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a8a20fed3e05b3a6866c5c58855deaf3c217ccd6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d0124848c7940aba73492e282506b32a13f2e30e","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53209.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53209.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53209.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2023-53209","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53209.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53209.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/05/seguranca/cve-2023-53209-wifi-mac80211-hwsim-fix-possible-nu-1764982893000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-4929-6x76-2xpw/GHSA-4929-6x76-2xpw.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53209","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53209.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0372.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0371","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0371.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53187","title":"Linux Kernel Btrfs 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Btrfs 文件系统的块组管理中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当新创建的块组在尚未完成创建流程之前被标记为未使用时，内核错误地将其从未块组列表移至未使用块组列表，但未正确处理引用计数，导致后续释放操作时触发释放后使用。本地攻击者可通过执行特定的 Btrfs 文件系统操作序列（如创建和删除子卷、触发块组回收）利用此漏洞，造成内核崩溃（系统拒绝服务），在特定条件下可能导致权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.4-rc6 及之前的版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53187"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T14:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:27Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.5 或更高版本（主线修复提交 0657b20c5a76，已合入 v6.5 正式版）。对于使用 5.15 LTS 内核的系统，升级至包含稳定版回滚补丁（6297644db23f）的 5.15.y 最新次版本；对于使用 6.1 LTS 的系统，升级至包含对应回滚补丁的 6.1.y 最新次版本。该漏洞位于 btrfs 模块的块组引用计数逻辑中，无配置层面缓解措施，必须通过内核代码补丁修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0657b20c5a76c938612f8409735a8830d257866e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6297644db23f77c02ae7961cc542d162629ae2c4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7569c4294ba6ff9f194635b14876198f8a687c4a","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53187.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53187.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53187","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/ddd7f6abfb101335ae481f591ddfde7fd91f7ed7/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-kernel/linux/cve-exclusion.inc","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53187.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53187.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53187.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-4xcf-q92v-qp8c/GHSA-4xcf-q92v-qp8c.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53187","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71165.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0371.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0370","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0370.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53178","title":"Linux kernel mm zswap 写入回刷竞争条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 zswap 压缩交换缓存的回写机制存在竞态条件漏洞（CWE-362），当 zswap 执行内存页面回写时，用户程序失效页面并分配新页面到同一交换偏移量，导致回写线程写入错误数据。攻击者可利用此竞态条件造成内存损坏，触发系统崩溃或信息泄露。该漏洞影响所有启用 zswap 功能的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危。通过限制 zswap 池大小并避免高并发内存压力场景可降低利用风险，官方已在内核主线中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53178"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T14:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:26Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.30+、6.3.4+ 或 6.4+ 版本（主线修复 commit: 04fc7816089c5a32c29a04ec94b998e219dfb946），或相应发行版已包含该补丁的内核包。如无法立即升级，可通过设置 /sys/module/zswap/parameters/max_pool_percent=0 临时禁用 zswap 以规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/04fc7816089c5a32c29a04ec94b998e219dfb946","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2cab13f500a6333bd2b853783ac76be9e4956f8a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba700ea13bf0105a4773c654f7d3bef8adb64ab2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53178.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53178.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53178.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53178","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53178.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53178.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-hjrq-8p9v-7m4p/GHSA-hjrq-8p9v-7m4p.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53178","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53178.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71162.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0370.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0367","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0367.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53152","title":"Linux Kernel AMDGPU 驱动资源释放不当漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 amdgpu 显卡驱动中存在资源未释放漏洞（CWE-772），当用户卸载 amdgpu 驱动模块时，PSP（平台安全处理器）分配的 BO（缓冲对象）未被正确释放，导致调用 amddrm_buddy_fini 时触发内核 calltrace 警告。本地攻击者可通过加载后卸载 amdgpu 驱动触发该漏洞，造成内核内存泄漏和系统稳定性问题。该漏洞影响使用 amdgpu 驱动的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。官方已通过将 psp_free_shared_bufs 移至 psp_sw_fini 修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53152"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T14:15:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:23Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.0 及以上版本，或合入补丁 commit 9b3c5c9b8b4e（\"drm/amdgpu: fix calltrace warning in amddrm_buddy_fini\"）。如无法升级内核，可避免在运行时卸载 amdgpu 驱动模块（rmmod amdgpu）以触发该内存释放路径，直到完成内核更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/01382501509871d0799bab6bd412c228486af5bf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/756d674117f5c451f415d1c4046b927052a90c14","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ab6f446c220db0c131f2071846afd835799be0fb","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53152.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53152.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53152","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53152.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53152.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53152.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-c3cj-qmvm-36gx/GHSA-c3cj-qmvm-36gx.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53152","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70748.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2023/CVE-2023-53152.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0367.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0366","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0366.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53149","title":"Linux Kernel ext4 文件系统页面回写拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ext4 文件系统存在死锁漏洞（CVE-2023-53149），源于 `ext4_writepages()` 函数在持有全局写页面锁（`sbi->s_writepages_rwsem`）时，因内存回收（fs_reclaim）触发递归调用再次申请同一锁，形成锁顺序冲突导致内核死锁。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，攻击者可通过构造特定文件 I/O 操作触发死锁条件，造成系统拒绝服务（DoS）。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等，建议更新至已修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53149"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T14:15:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:23Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.9 及以上版本（或对应发行版如 Ubuntu 22.04 升级至 6.2.x 内核、RHEL 9 升级至 kernel-5.14.0-362 以上），该问题已在 commit 2e4ce60f7f4d 中修复。如无法立即升级，可通过内核启动参数 `ext4.no_writeback_recursion=1` 临时缓解，但建议优先内核更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/00d873c17e29cc32d90ca852b82685f1673acaa5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2ec97dc90df40c50e509809dc9a198638a7e18b6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4b4340bf04ce9a52061f15000ecedd126abc093c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53149.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53149.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53149","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53149.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53149.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53149.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e